.agents
.agent*
# TASK-MVP-006/R65. Deploy-time-only marker (git commit hash of what was
# actually deployed) - written fresh by the deployment process itself
# (`git rev-parse HEAD > APP_COMMIT`), never committed - see
# docs/architecture/production-deployment.md "Deployment source of truth".
/APP_COMMIT
# TASK-OPS-019/R77. Same convention as APP_COMMIT above, but records which
# commit the estore-app:rollback/estore-web:rollback image pair
# represents - written fresh by docker/production/deploy.sh, never
# committed - see docs/architecture/production-deployment.md "Docker disk
# hygiene".
/ROLLBACK_COMMIT
# TASK-OPS-019/R77. Runtime lock file used by docker/production/deploy.sh
# and docker/production/docker-disk-hygiene.sh to serialize deployments
# against the scheduled disk-hygiene cron backstop - created fresh by
# `flock` at runtime, never committed.
/.docker-deploy.lock
.claude
.cursor
